{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining Survivors is an incremental game in which you mine resources whilst fending of swarms of enemies in a bullet-heaven environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/extras/0529911b3d01f502e39127533bd0dba9.poster.avif?t=1754928141\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/extras/0529911b3d01f502e39127533bd0dba9.webm?t=1754928141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/extras/0529911b3d01f502e39127533bd0dba9.mp4?t=1754928141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You mine resources in short bursts, before either dying to enemies or fending them off long enough to escape with extra rewards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You then return to the shop, where you spend your resources to upgrade your character and unlock new levels and areas to mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/extras/99872caa8233fed7796dea23de049a8a.poster.avif?t=1754928141\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/extras/99872caa8233fed7796dea23de049a8a.webm?t=1754928141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/extras/99872caa8233fed7796dea23de049a8a.mp4?t=1754928141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay / Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet Heaven combat against enemy hordes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine rocks to gather resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend resources on upgrades and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incremental progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory of weapons and mods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New territories to unlock as you progress</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2322450?t=1754928141","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2322450?t=1754928141","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/b6435618e67892fbd9ab182c7472b6bb5935a3d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754928141","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/b6435618e67892fbd9ab182c7472b6bb5935a3d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754928141","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3499490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining Survivors is an incremental game in which you mine resources whilst fending of swarms of enemies in a bullet-heaven environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/extras/0529911b3d01f502e39127533bd0dba9.poster.avif?t=1754928141\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/extras/0529911b3d01f502e39127533bd0dba9.webm?t=1754928141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/extras/0529911b3d01f502e39127533bd0dba9.mp4?t=1754928141\" ty